    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging yet fascinating subject for me. While I appreciate its logical structure and problem-solving aspects, it often feels abstract compared to my preferred subjects like physics or art. My PhD in physics required strong mathematical skills, but I sometimes struggle with the more theoretical or complex parts of math. It's a tool I respect, though not always one I enjoy deeply.",
